{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerial_Knight\u2019s <strong>Dropshot</strong> is a high-speed, stylized FPS / Race where you play as Smoke Wallace. As a kid, he was bitten by a radioactive dragon, turning his skin purple and giving him the power to fire bullets from his fingertips. Thrown into deadly sky battles for revenge, you race rivals, fight dragons, move fast, shoot smart, and look cool when you land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/extras/a222c54d0edf855bc6f6e24cbef3b049.avif?t=1768406384\" width=1024 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Fall:</strong> Race against four other players to reach the ground first \u2014 and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Ammo:</strong> Start with only limited ammo. Use it wisely to eliminate threats &amp; protect yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slipstream Speed:</strong> Use your enemies\u2019 slipstreams to gain speed, but they can do the same to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Rounds:</strong> Each round lasts 30-60 seconds \u2014 fast-paced action that never lets up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Visuals:</strong> Stunning environments and thrilling perspectives as you plummet toward the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Soundtrack:</strong> Pulse-pounding music and sound effects with some style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Modes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/extras/3120c16ab21b1b2a069f11a503cf7a2f.avif?t=1768406384\" width=1024 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Aerial_Knight\u2019s DropShot</i>, you\u2019ve got three unique ways to throw yourself out of a perfectly &quot;good&quot; plane:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Mode</strong> \u2013 You and a swarm of enemies are dropped into freefall. Take out as many as you can before hitting the ground while dodging bullets, avoiding obstacles, and making sure you\u2019re not the one getting taken out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against massive, over-the-top bosses in midair. Deal as much damage as possible before they either wipe you out or beat you to the ground. All while avoiding deadly traps, jamming to a dope soundtrack, and keeping your head on a swivel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Challenges</strong> \u2013 Go head-to-head with your persistent rival in a high-speed dive to capture a falling Egg before they do. Hit slipstreams, grab score multipliers, and watch out every time you beat them, they\u2019ll upgrade their gear and come back faster in the next race.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live out your dream of finger-blasting multiple enemies as you all fall to your death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/extras/01cae23a21ab2b66300212b6855fc017.avif?t=1768406384\" width=350 height=210 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465190?t=1768406384","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465190?t=1768406384","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/e7e4be30f0798c6be2444245422e4840fc67e2ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768406384","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/e7e4be30f0798c6be2444245422e4840fc67e2ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768406384","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aerial_Knight\u2019s <strong>Dropshot</strong> is a high-speed, stylized FPS / Race where you play as Smoke Wallace. As a kid, he was bitten by a radioactive dragon, turning his skin purple and giving him the power to fire bullets from his fingertips. Thrown into deadly sky battles for revenge, you race rivals, fight dragons, move fast, shoot smart, and look cool when you land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/extras/a222c54d0edf855bc6f6e24cbef3b049.avif?t=1768406384\" width=1024 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Fall:</strong> Race against four other players to reach the ground first \u2014 and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Ammo:</strong> Start with only limited ammo. Use it wisely to eliminate threats &amp; protect yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slipstream Speed:</strong> Use your enemies\u2019 slipstreams to gain speed, but they can do the same to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Rounds:</strong> Each round lasts 30-60 seconds \u2014 fast-paced action that never lets up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Visuals:</strong> Stunning environments and thrilling perspectives as you plummet toward the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Soundtrack:</strong> Pulse-pounding music and sound effects with some style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Modes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/extras/3120c16ab21b1b2a069f11a503cf7a2f.avif?t=1768406384\" width=1024 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Aerial_Knight\u2019s DropShot</i>, you\u2019ve got three unique ways to throw yourself out of a perfectly &quot;good&quot; plane:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard Mode</strong> \u2013 You and a swarm of enemies are dropped into freefall. Take out as many as you can before hitting the ground while dodging bullets, avoiding obstacles, and making sure you\u2019re not the one getting taken out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against massive, over-the-top bosses in midair. Deal as much damage as possible before they either wipe you out or beat you to the ground. All while avoiding deadly traps, jamming to a dope soundtrack, and keeping your head on a swivel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Challenges</strong> \u2013 Go head-to-head with your persistent rival in a high-speed dive to capture a falling Egg before they do. Hit slipstreams, grab score multipliers, and watch out every time you beat them, they\u2019ll upgrade their gear and come back faster in the next race.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live out your dream of finger-blasting multiple enemies as you all fall to your death.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/extras/01cae23a21ab2b66300212b6855fc017.avif?t=1768406384\" width=350 height=210 /></span></p>","developers":["Aerial_Knight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465190/7fb2d8e3fc45f012a2e923029aa9a47299c5e03d/header.jpg?t=1768406384","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Aerial_Knight TM","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3465190/1087094330/5556080829888c399bb01441fbe0ba253135f610/1768391681/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768406383","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3465190/1087094330/5556080829888c399bb01441fbe0ba253135f610/1768391681/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768406383","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3465190/1087094330/5556080829888c399bb01441fbe0ba253135f610/1768391681/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768406383","id":257264719,"name":"Aerial_Knigh